        "content": "What function calculates the number of stock index futures contracts needed to rebalance a portfolio from 80% equities and 20% bonds to 60% equities and 40% bonds, using portfolio value, equity beta, futures index level, contract multiplier, and futures beta, with the result rounded to three decimal places?",
